  "statement": "Find \\(\\log _{n}\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\log _{n-1}\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right) \\cdots \\log _{2}\\left(\\frac{1}{n}\\right)\\) in terms of \\(n\\).",
